ecent inflow of cheap Ukrainian grain into the country, coupled with what some see as discriminatory treatment toward the Romanian ethnic minority in Ukraine. \u2013RT\n\nSpeaking on the sidelines of the International Monetary Fund (IMF) and World Bank meetings in Marrakech on Saturday, Ukrainian Finance Minister Sergey Marchenko admitted that Kiev is being forced to make \u201ctwice the effort right now to convince our partners to provide us with support compared to the last annual meetings [in spring].\u201d Part of that is because the U.S. has found another war to support, and one involving religion will be easier to escalate.", "language": "en", "metadata": {"sentence_id": "1"}, "frames": [{"name": "Level_of_force_resistance", "roles": [{"name": "Resisting_entity", "filler": "West", "idxs": [16, 16]}, {"name": "Domain", "filler": "with supporting Ukrainian President Vladimir Zelensky in the war with Russia", "idxs": [21, 31]}], "idxs": [20, 20], "activation": "patience"}, {"name": "Hostile_encounter", "roles": [{"name": "Side_1", "filler": "Ukraine \u2019s", "idxs": [12, 13]}], "idxs": [14, 14], "activation": "War"}, {"name": "Leadership", "roles": [{"name": "Leader", "filler": "Vladimir Zelensky", "idxs": [25, 26]}, {"name": "Governed", "filler": "Ukrainian", "idxs": [23, 23]}], "idxs": [24, 24], "activation": "President"}, {"name": "Taking_sides", "roles": [{"name": "Side", "filler": "Ukrainian President Vladimir Zelensky", "idxs": [23, 26]}, {"name": "Cognizer", "filler": "The West", "idxs": [15, 16]}, {"name": "Action", "filler": "in the war with Russia", "idxs": [27, 31]}], "idxs": [22, 22], "activation": "supporting"}, {"name": "Earnings_and_losses", "roles": [{"name": "Earner", "filler": "The West", "idxs": [15, 16]}, {"name": "Earnings", "filler": "patience with supporting Ukrainian President Vladimir Zelensky in the war with Russia", "idxs": [20, 31]}], "idxs": [19, 19], "activation": "losing"}, {"name": "Change_position_on_a_scale", "roles": [{"name": 